{"id":98551,"slug":"98551-vi-sao-innerhtml-va-dangerouslysetinnerhtml-nguy-hiem-khi-buoc-phai-render-html","category":"Security","subcategory":"Sanitize","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Vì sao `innerHTML` và `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` nguy hiểm? Khi buộc phải render HTML của user thì sanitize thế nào cho đúng?","question_en":"Why are `innerHTML` and `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` dangerous? If you must render user HTML, how do you sanitize it properly?","answer_vi":"Cả hai đều **parse chuỗi thành HTML thật** rồi gắn vào DOM. Mọi thẻ, thuộc tính sự kiện trong chuỗi đều có hiệu lực. React mặc định escape khi bạn render `{value}`, nên `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` chính là chỗ bạn **tự tay tắt lớp bảo vệ đó** — tên prop dài dòng là cố ý.\n\nLưu ý: `<script>` chèn qua `innerHTML` **không chạy**, nên nhiều người tưởng là an toàn. Nhưng handler thì chạy:\n\n```html\n<img src=x onerror=\"fetch('/api/me').then(r=>r.text()).then(send)\">\n<svg><animate onbegin=\"...\"></svg>\n```\n\n**Cách làm đúng:**\n1. Ưu tiên **không render HTML**. Nếu chỉ cần in chữ, dùng `textContent` hoặc `{value}` của React.\n2. Nếu cần rich text (bình luận, mô tả từ CMS), **sanitize bằng DOMPurify** — thư viện đã qua nhiều vòng kiểm định, đừng tự viết regex lọc thẻ.\n\n```tsx\nimport DOMPurify from 'dompurify'\n\nconst clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(userHtml, {\n  ALLOWED_TAGS: ['p', 'b', 'i', 'a', 'ul', 'li', 'code'],\n  ALLOWED_ATTR: ['href'],\n})\nreturn <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: clean }} />\n```\n\n3. Sanitize ở **thời điểm render**, không phải lúc lưu — vì cùng một chuỗi lưu trong DB có thể được dùng ở nhiều ngữ cảnh khác nhau, và bản DOMPurify sẽ được vá theo thời gian.\n4. Whitelist thẻ/thuộc tính thay vì blacklist. Blacklist luôn thiếu","answer_en":"Both **parse a string into real HTML** and attach it to the DOM. Every tag and event attribute in that string becomes live. React escapes by default when you render `{value}`, so `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` is exactly where you **switch that protection off** — the verbose prop name is deliberate.\n\nNote: a `<script>` inserted via `innerHTML` **does not execute**, which fools people into thinking it is safe. Handlers do run:\n\n```html\n<img src=x onerror=\"fetch('/api/me').then(r=>r.text()).then(send)\">\n<svg><animate onbegin=\"...\"></svg>\n```\n\n**Doing it right:**\n1. Prefer **not rendering HTML at all**. For plain text use `textContent` or React's `{value}`.\n2. If you truly need rich text (comments, CMS descriptions), **sanitize with DOMPurify** — a heavily audited library. Do not hand-roll a tag-stripping regex.\n\n```tsx\nimport DOMPurify from 'dompurify'\n\nconst clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(userHtml, {\n  ALLOWED_TAGS: ['p', 'b', 'i', 'a', 'ul', 'li', 'code'],\n  ALLOWED_ATTR: ['href'],\n})\nreturn <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: clean }} />\n```\n\n3. Sanitize **at render time**, not at write time — the same stored string may be reused in different contexts, and DOMPurify keeps getting patched.\n4. Whitelist tags/attributes instead of blacklisting. A blacklist is always incomplete","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Cả hai đều <strong>parse chuỗi thành HTML thật</strong> rồi gắn vào DOM. Mọi thẻ, thuộc tính sự kiện trong chuỗi đều có hiệu lực. React mặc định escape khi bạn render <code>{value}</code>, nên <code>dangerouslySetInnerHTML</code> chính là chỗ bạn <strong>tự tay tắt lớp bảo vệ đó</strong> — tên prop dài dòng là cố ý.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Lưu ý: <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> chèn qua <code>innerHTML</code> <strong>không chạy</strong>, nên nhiều người tưởng là an toàn. Nhưng handler thì chạy:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;img src=x onerror=&quot;fetch('/api/me').then(r=&gt;r.text()).then(send)&quot;&gt;\n&lt;svg&gt;&lt;animate onbegin=&quot;...&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">x</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onerror</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;fetch(&#x27;/api/me&#x27;).then(r=&gt;r.text()).then(send)&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">svg</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">animate</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onbegin</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">svg</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Cách làm đúng:</strong><br/>1. Ưu tiên <strong>không render HTML</strong>. Nếu chỉ cần in chữ, dùng <code>textContent</code> hoặc <code>{value}</code> của React.<br/>2. Nếu cần rich text (bình luận, mô tả từ CMS), <strong>sanitize bằng DOMPurify</strong> — thư viện đã qua nhiều vòng kiểm định, đừng tự viết regex lọc thẻ.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">tsx</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import DOMPurify from 'dompurify'\n\nconst clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(userHtml, {\n  ALLOWED_TAGS: ['p', 'b', 'i', 'a', 'ul', 'li', 'code'],\n  ALLOWED_ATTR: ['href'],\n})\nreturn &lt;div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: clean }} /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">DOMPurify</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dompurify&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> clean = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">DOMPurify</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">sanitize</span>(userHtml, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ALLOWED_TAGS</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;p&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;i&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ul&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;li&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;code&#x27;</span>],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ALLOWED_ATTR</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;href&#x27;</span>],\n})\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dangerouslySetInnerHTML</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">__html:</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">clean</span> }} /&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">3. Sanitize ở <strong>thời điểm render</strong>, không phải lúc lưu — vì cùng một chuỗi lưu trong DB có thể được dùng ở nhiều ngữ cảnh khác nhau, và bản DOMPurify sẽ được vá theo thời gian.<br/>4. Whitelist thẻ/thuộc tính thay vì blacklist. Blacklist luôn thiếu.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Both <strong>parse a string into real HTML</strong> and attach it to the DOM. Every tag and event attribute in that string becomes live. React escapes by default when you render <code>{value}</code>, so <code>dangerouslySetInnerHTML</code> is exactly where you <strong>switch that protection off</strong> — the verbose prop name is deliberate.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Note: a <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> inserted via <code>innerHTML</code> <strong>does not execute</strong>, which fools people into thinking it is safe. Handlers do run:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;img src=x onerror=&quot;fetch('/api/me').then(r=&gt;r.text()).then(send)&quot;&gt;\n&lt;svg&gt;&lt;animate onbegin=&quot;...&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">img</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">src</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">x</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onerror</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;fetch(&#x27;/api/me&#x27;).then(r=&gt;r.text()).then(send)&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">svg</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">animate</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onbegin</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">svg</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Doing it right:</strong><br/>1. Prefer <strong>not rendering HTML at all</strong>. For plain text use <code>textContent</code> or React's <code>{value}</code>.<br/>2. If you truly need rich text (comments, CMS descriptions), <strong>sanitize with DOMPurify</strong> — a heavily audited library. Do not hand-roll a tag-stripping regex.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">tsx</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"import DOMPurify from 'dompurify'\n\nconst clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(userHtml, {\n  ALLOWED_TAGS: ['p', 'b', 'i', 'a', 'ul', 'li', 'code'],\n  ALLOWED_ATTR: ['href'],\n})\nreturn &lt;div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: clean }} /&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">DOMPurify</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dompurify&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> clean = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">DOMPurify</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">sanitize</span>(userHtml, {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ALLOWED_TAGS</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;p&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;b&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;i&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ul&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;li&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;code&#x27;</span>],\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">ALLOWED_ATTR</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;href&#x27;</span>],\n})\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dangerouslySetInnerHTML</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">{{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">__html:</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">clean</span> }} /&gt;</span></span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">3. Sanitize <strong>at render time</strong>, not at write time — the same stored string may be reused in different contexts, and DOMPurify keeps getting patched.<br/>4. Whitelist tags/attributes instead of blacklisting. A blacklist is always incomplete.</p>","references":[{"label":"OWASP Cheat Sheet — Cross Site Scripting Prevention","url":"https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Cross_Site_Scripting_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet.html"},{"label":"MDN — Web security","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Security"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/791-xss-cross-site-scripting-la-gi-cac-loai-xss-va-cach-phong-chong","title":"XSS (Cross-Site Scripting) là gì? Các loại XSS và cách phòng chống?"},{"url":"/q/792-csrf-cross-site-request-forgery-la-gi-cach-phong-chong","title":"CSRF (Cross-Site Request Forgery) là gì? Cách phòng chống?"},{"url":"/q/793-content-security-policy-csp-la-gi-cach-cau-hinh","title":"Content Security Policy (CSP) là gì? Cách cấu hình?"},{"url":"/q/794-oauth-2-0-la-gi-luong-authorization-code-flow-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"OAuth 2.0 là gì? Luồng Authorization Code flow hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/795-https-va-tls-la-gi-tai-sao-bat-buoc-phai-dung","title":"HTTPS và TLS là gì? Tại sao bắt buộc phải dùng?"},{"url":"/q/796-cors-la-gi-tai-sao-browser-enforce-same-origin-policy","title":"CORS là gì? Tại sao browser enforce same-origin policy?"},{"url":"/q/797-security-headers-quan-trong-trong-web-application-la-gi","title":"Security headers quan trọng trong web application là gì?"},{"url":"/q/798-sql-injection-la-gi-cach-phong-chong-trong-node-js","title":"SQL Injection là gì? Cách phòng chống trong Node.js?"}]}